  unitName: Loch Ness
  unitId: 20113
  unitNumber: 139
  description: A giant dragon strongest among the sea drakes and deathly feared by
    man. Extremely intelligent, it will not attack others as long as it is unharmed.
    Its abilities far surpass a normal sea drake, to the extent that storms rise
    when it appears. Loch Ness, leader of the proud sea drakes, is an impressive
    sight, and some sailors worship it.
  summonDesc: You, he who subdued me.<br>Be not insolent.<br>Forget not the beauty
    of virtue.
  fusionDesc: With just this power,<br>I rule the sea.
  evoDesc: With your help I became leader of the sea drakes.<br>I will use my abilities
    for you.
  element: 2
  rarity: 3
